Generate a fictional document body and optional metadata from the supplied
structured document facts.

Requirements:
- Preserve the hidden document class and its required factual features without
  naming that class in metadata or visible text unless naturally unavoidable.
- Include optional realistic formatting, headers, OCR noise, dates, amounts,
  or filenames only when permitted by WORLD_FACTS.
- Add at most one controlled distractor feature.
- Do not mention labels, task categories, or expected classification.
- Return only JSON.

OUTPUT_SCHEMA:
{
  "document_text": "string",
  "metadata": {"filename": "string", "source": "string", "date": "string|null"},
  "noise_tags": ["string"]
}
